windows.networking.hostname: Implement HostName.

Type, CanonicalName, DisplayName, IsEqual, IPInformation and IStringable for domain
names (IDN decoded, lowercase canonical form), IPv4, IPv6 and Bluetooth addresses;
IHostNameStatics::Compare; a private interface lets windows.networking.connectivity
attach the IPInformation of local addresses.

